// Bourns's 5.0SMDJ datasheet, REV. 08/26, read 2026-10-15. Its electrical table pairs part number
// 5.0SMDJ60A with marking 5PGK (unidirectional; the bidirectional 5.0SMDJ60CA is 5BGK), and gives
// VBR 66.70 to 73.70 V at 1 mA, VRWM 60.0 V, IR 2 uA at VRWM, and Vc 96.8 V at Ipp 51.7 A
// (10/1000 us). The family is 5000 W, DO-214AB (SMC). Other makers sell 5.0SMDJ60A too; this row
// is Bourns's, and a board part carrying the 5PGK code under another maker's logo matches it by code.
data extdeps_external_authority_anchor: ExternalAuthority = ExternalAuthority {
  uri: Uri {
    scheme: Https
    locator: "www.bourns.com/docs/product-datasheets/5-0smdj.pdf"
  }
}

